Hi all, during SmartPay PROD testing we found two transaction IDs which are present in FDP_UK_CARDS_DB.PAYMENT_GATEWAY_TRANSACTION_STATUS, but no corresponding records are available in FDP_UK_CARDS_DB.PAYMENT_GATEWAY_AUTHORIZATION_TRANSACTION:

000bc4c2-ab16-4bf8-98d2-84c04e36b46c
0099d822-e5b0-4bde-a9ad-d1ad70f71088

Since the BDP logic joins the authorisation transaction table to the latest transaction status, these transactions will not flow through to the final BDP aggregation when the authorisation record is missing.

Could you please help us confirm whether this is an expected source scenario, or whether the corresponding authorisation records are missing/delayed in FDP?


